 {"type": "text", "id": "ARDIe9", "name": "Text", "content": "1. 确认 Q4 Roadmap 的三个里程碑，设计稿周三前定稿", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t1", "x": 64, "y": 196}, {"type": "text", "id": "eaRQhO", "name": "Text", "content": "2. 剪贴板历史只保留列表，去掉预览区", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t1", "x": 64, "y": 228}, {"type": "text", "id": "JVz8RY", "name": "Text", "content": "3. 合同打印两份带到会议室，法务 10 分钟过一遍", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t1", "x": 64, "y": 260}, {"type": "text", "id": "TKo6h7", "name": "Text", "content": "4. 上线前在三台机器上测试 Liquid Glass 的深浅色", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t1", "x": 64, "y": 292}, {"type": "text", "id": "QwwjwK", "name": "Text", "content": "备注", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 17, "fill": "$t1", "fontWeight": "600", "x": 64, "y": 352}, {"type": "text", "id": "DoJxdO", "name": "Text", "content": "会后把录屏和白板截图发到群里。", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t1", "x": 64, "y": 388}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "JPBaV7", "name": "Chip row", "x": 220, "y": 230, "padding": 4, "gap": 2, "alignItems": "center", "fill": "$glass", "cornerRadius": 19, "stroke": "$glass-stroke", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeAlignment": "inner", "effect": [{"type": "background_blur", "radius": 50}, {"type": "shadow", "shadowType": "outer", "color": "#00000038", "offset": {"x": 0, "y": 16}, "blur": 44}, {"type": "shadow", "shadowType": "outer", "color": "#0000001A", "offset": {"x": 0, "y": 1}, "blur": 3}], "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "LIwFlH", "name": "Chip · image", "height": 36, "cornerRadius": 15, "padding": [0, 5], "gap": 6, "alignItems": "center", "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "al6MYO", "name": "Thumb", "fill": "#FFFFFF", "width": 40, "height": 26, "cornerRadius": 5, "clip": true, "layout": "none", "stroke": "$hair", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeAlignment": "inner", "children": [{"type": "rectangle", "id": "eYHttP", "name": "Title", "width": 33.6, "height": 1.56, "fill": "#E8E8ED", "x": 3.2, "y": 3.12,